@startuml TECH-SEQ-03-Formation-Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #F1C40F

title Qualibot-Hub — Séquence Technique : Workflow Validation Formation (MERN)

actor "Demandeur" as User
participant "React\n(/formations)" as Client <<React>>
participant "api.ts" as Api <<Axios>>
participant "FormationDemandeRoutes\n(/api/v1/formation-demandes)" as Router <<Express>>
participant "FormationController" as Ctrl <<Controller>>
participant "WorkflowService" as Workflow <<Service>>
database "MongoDB" as DB <<Mongoose>>

== Soumission de Demande ==
User -> Client : Saisit le besoin en formation
Client -> Api : POST /api/v1/formation-demandes
Api -> Router : HTTP POST
Router -> Ctrl : requestFormation(req, res)

== Routing Dynamique (Site/Direction) ==
Ctrl -> DB : const user = await User.findById(req.user.id).populate('employee_id')
DB --> Ctrl : userDoc (with site_id)
Ctrl -> Workflow : getHierarchyChain(userDoc.employee_id.site_id)
Workflow -> DB : Site.findById(site_id).select('responsables_validation')
DB --> Workflow : liste_responsables

Workflow -> Workflow : construire Tableau steps\n({ validateur_id, ordre, statut: enAttente })
Workflow --> Ctrl : validationSteps

Ctrl -> DB : await Formation_Demande.create({ demandeur_id, ..., circuit_validation: validationSteps })
DB --> Ctrl : demandeDoc
Ctrl --> Api : HTTP 201 Created { demande: demandeDoc }
Api --> Client : Succès
Client -> User : "Demande transmise au superviseur"

== Validation (Étape +1) ==
note over Ctrl, DB: Un validateur accède à l'endpoint de validation : POST /:id/validate
@enduml
